## 8. How to Suppress (Ignore Directives)

If this pattern is required for an intentional exception, suppress the diagnostic using the canonical Charites Rule ID:

```astro
<!-- charites:ignore {{ .ID }} intentional exception -->
```

```tsx
// charites:ignore {{ .ID }} intentional exception
```

